{"2340460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ONE WAY HOME", "steam_appid": 2340460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/a6aac83ede9def1424c110ae14ae2dd2.poster.avif?t=1762597032\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/a6aac83ede9def1424c110ae14ae2dd2.webm?t=1762597032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/a6aac83ede9def1424c110ae14ae2dd2.mp4?t=1762597032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Thousands of Lies. Hundreds of horrors. Ten hours. One Way Home</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jimmy Taylor is a boy who finds himself at the center of mysterious events in his hometown. Returning home from school in the evening, Jimmy is involved in a car accident. Waking up, he finds himself on deserted streets in a mysterious place from which it is now up to him to get out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lonely and lost, he searches for a way home, encountering unknown and sometimes frightening mysteries and events along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Many Roads</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/9892ac308fecd385cc4c75ac8899e7ed.poster.avif?t=1762597032\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/9892ac308fecd385cc4c75ac8899e7ed.webm?t=1762597032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/9892ac308fecd385cc4c75ac8899e7ed.mp4?t=1762597032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jimmy will have several roads to choose from. Each road will have its own obstacles, secrets, and rewards. From these choices, Jimmy will pump up his skills, change the progression of the story, and get closer to one of the four endings. Help Jimmy build his one and only and unique path home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;Crayon story&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/2d392dc31e968db022513609a0564c6d.poster.avif?t=1762597032\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/2d392dc31e968db022513609a0564c6d.webm?t=1762597032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/2d392dc31e968db022513609a0564c6d.mp4?t=1762597032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated crayon drawings tell you the story of this world and its inhabitants, of secrets and mysteries, of Jimmy and his destiny. Find all the parts of the “crayon story” and find out the true reasons for what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unique enemies and bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/10af5f7e56f75b3f1c10145cb26af7ed.poster.avif?t=1762597032\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/10af5f7e56f75b3f1c10145cb26af7ed.webm?t=1762597032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/10af5f7e56f75b3f1c10145cb26af7ed.mp4?t=1762597032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet distorted creatures in your path, scary and frightening. Hide and run or they will consume Jimmy's mind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A variety of puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/5015df1507f75ca1e2b6bde7dc053bed.poster.avif?t=1762597032\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/5015df1507f75ca1e2b6bde7dc053bed.webm?t=1762597032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/5015df1507f75ca1e2b6bde7dc053bed.mp4?t=1762597032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jimmy will face many obstacles on the way home and only you can help him. Show your wit and find the right solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Item Throws</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/ae80a3c19ee11966de349333599be4e1.poster.avif?t=1762597032\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/ae80a3c19ee11966de349333599be4e1.webm?t=1762597032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/ae80a3c19ee11966de349333599be4e1.mp4?t=1762597032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throws will not only help you distract the enemy, but also help you solve the puzzle. Jimmy picks up objects and throws them accurately at the target with your help. Look for places to throw and maybe you will discover something new.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/a6aac83ede9def1424c110ae14ae2dd2.poster.avif?t=1762597032\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/a6aac83ede9def1424c110ae14ae2dd2.webm?t=1762597032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340460/extras/a6aac83ede9def1424c110ae14ae2dd2.mp4?t=1762597032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Thousands of Lies. Hundreds of horrors. Ten hours. One Way Home</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jimmy Taylor is a boy who finds himself at the center of mysterious events in his hometown. Returning home from school in the evening, Jimmy is involved in a car accident. Waking up, he finds himself on deserted streets in a mysterious place from which it is now up to him to get out.</p><p class=\"bb_